// Stairs to a ledge with the seed and an ember, then a chasm with the stone; the coral is a mound.
name Coral
rule B1/S12345678
steps 4
hint You woke without a seed. One lies on the ledge above, where an ember paces. Fetch it, drop down, plant on the stone in the chasm, get clear, Grow.
tip Under this law nothing dies, so the coral is a mound around the stone. Its top is a hill you can walk over to the far side.
intro Here nothing dies. Everything ever born is still here, and something else still moves: an ember of the old growth, pacing its ledge. It burns what it touches.
outro The origin is still alive at the heart of the reef. Some things keep their beginning.
